{"task_id": "Mbpp/74", "solution": "def is_samepatterns(array1, array2):\n    \"\"\"Checks if two arrays follow the same structural pattern based on element repetition.\"\"\"\n    if len(array1) != len(array2):\n        return False\n\n    def _generate_pattern_signature(arr):\n        \"\"\"Generates a list of pattern IDs for the given array.\"\"\"\n        element_to_id = {}\n        next_id = 0\n        signature = []\n        for element in arr:\n            if element not in element_to_id:\n                element_to_id[element] = next_id\n                next_id += 1\n            signature.append(element_to_id[element])\n        return signature\n\n    signature1 = _generate_pattern_signature(array1)\n    signature2 = _generate_pattern_signature(array2)\n\n    return signature1 == signature2"}
