{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "def sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\n    The sequence is defined by P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) with P(1)=1, P(2)=1.\"\"\"\n    # Memoization dictionary to store calculated sequence values, initialized with base cases.\n    memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\n    def _get_p(k: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Helper to calculate P(k) using memoization.\"\"\"\n        if k in memo:\n            return memo[k]\n\n        # Iteratively calculate and store values from 3 up to k.\n        for i in range(3, k + 1):\n            if i not in memo:\n                memo[i] = _get_p(_get_p(i - 1)) + _get_p(i - _get_p(i - 1))\n        return memo[k]\n\n    return _get_p(n)"}
