{"task_id": "Mbpp/96", "solution": "def divisor(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the number of divisors for a given integer n.\n    Iterates from 1 up to the square root of n to find divisors efficiently.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    n = abs(n)\n    count = 0\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            if i * i == n:\n                count += 1\n            else:\n                count += 2\n        i += 1\n    return count"}
