{"task_id": "Mbpp/100", "solution": "def _is_palindrome(num: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a number is a palindrome.\"\"\"\n    s = str(num)\n    return s == s[::-1]\n\ndef _increment_palindrome(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Generates the next candidate number by incrementing.\"\"\"\n    return num + 1\n\ndef next_smallest_palindrome(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the next smallest palindrome greater than the specified integer.\n    It repeatedly increments the number until a palindrome is found.\n    \"\"\"\n    candidate = _increment_palindrome(n)\n    while True:\n        if _is_palindrome(candidate):\n            return candidate\n        candidate = _increment_palindrome(candidate)"}
