{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "import math\n\ndef eulerian_num(n: int, m: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the Eulerian number A(n, m).\n    This number counts permutations of {1, ..., n} with exactly m ascents.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = 0\n    for k in range(m + 1):\n        # The formula for A(n, m) is sum_{k=0 to m} (-1)^k * C(n + 1, k) * (m - k + 1)^n\n        term = ((-1)**k) * math.comb(n + 1, k) * ((m - k + 1)**n)\n        result += term\n    \n    return result"}
