{"task_id": "Mbpp/111", "solution": "def common_in_nested_lists(nested_lists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds common elements across all sublists within a nested list structure.\n    Returns a list of elements that appear in every sublist.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not nested_lists:\n        return []\n\n    # Initialize the set of common elements with the elements from the first sublist\n    common_elements = set(nested_lists[0])\n\n    # Iterate through the remaining sublists and find the intersection\n    for sublist in nested_lists[1:]:\n        common_elements = common_elements.intersection(set(sublist))\n    \n    # Convert the resulting set back to a list\n    return list(common_elements)"}
