{"task_id": "Mbpp/237", "solution": "def normalize_tuple(t):\n    \"\"\"Normalizes a tuple (a, b) to its canonical form (min(a, b), max(a, b)).\"\"\"\n    return tuple(sorted(t))\n\ndef check_occurences(tuple_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts occurrences of normalized tuples in a list, treating (a, b) and (b, a) as equivalent.\n    Returns a dictionary mapping each unique normalized tuple to its count.\n    \"\"\"\n    counts = {}\n    for t in tuple_list:\n        normalized_t = normalize_tuple(t)\n        counts[normalized_t] = counts.get(normalized_t, 0) + 1\n    return counts"}
