{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given n.\n    This function computes C(n,k) for k=0, 2, 4, ... up to n and sums them.\n    \"\"\"\n    def factorial(num: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Computes the factorial of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n        if num == 0:\n            return 1\n        res = 1\n        for i in range(1, num + 1):\n            res *= i\n        return res\n\n    def calculate_binomial_coefficient(n_val: int, k_val: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n_val, k_val).\"\"\"\n        if k_val < 0 or k_val > n_val:\n            return 0\n        return factorial(n_val) // (factorial(k_val) * factorial(n_val - k_val))\n\n    def is_even(num: int) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a number is even.\"\"\"\n        return num % 2 == 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(n + 1):\n        if is_even(k):\n            total_sum += calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    return total_sum"}
