{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "def find_lucas(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n'th Lucas number using an iterative approach.\n    Handles base cases L(0)=2 and L(1)=1, and computes L(n) = L(n-1) + L(n-2) for n > 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    elif n == 1:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Initialize L(0) and L(1)\n    l0 = 2\n    l1 = 1\n    \n    # Iterate from L(2) up to L(n)\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        next_lucas = l0 + l1\n        l0 = l1\n        l1 = next_lucas\n        \n    return l1"}
