{"task_id": "Mbpp/395", "solution": "def first_non_repeating_character(input_string: str) -> str | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first non-repeated character in a given string.\n    Returns None if all characters are repeated or for an empty string.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _count_characters(s: str) -> dict[str, int]:\n        \"\"\"Counts the frequency of each character in a string.\"\"\"\n        counts = {}\n        for char in s:\n            counts[char] = counts.get(char, 0) + 1\n        return counts\n\n    def _find_first_unique(s: str, char_counts: dict[str, int]) -> str | None:\n        \"\"\"Finds the first character with a count of 1 in string order.\"\"\"\n        for char in s:\n            if char_counts[char] == 1:\n                return char\n        return None\n\n    if not input_string:\n        return None\n\n    char_counts = _count_characters(input_string)\n    return _find_first_unique(input_string, char_counts)"}
