{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of cubes of the first n even natural numbers.\n    Assumes n is a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        even_num = 2 * i\n        total_sum += even_num ** 3\n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    It uses a direct mathematical formula for efficiency.\n    \"\"\"\n    # The sum of the cubes of the first n natural numbers is ((n * (n + 1)) / 2)**2\n    # To find the average, divide this sum by n.\n    # Simplified formula for the average: n * (n + 1)**2 / 4\n    average = n * (n + 1)**2 / 4\n    return average"}
