{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    if number < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input must be a non-negative integer.\")\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Handle the special case for 0\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    while number > 0:\n        total_sum += number % 10  # Get the last digit and add to sum\n        number //= 10             # Remove the last digit\n    return total_sum"}
