{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "def last(array: list, target) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Find the last position of an element in a sorted array using binary search.\"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(array) - 1\n    result = -1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = low + (high - low) // 2\n        if array[mid] == target:\n            result = mid\n            low = mid + 1  # Try to find further occurrences in the right half\n        elif array[mid] < target:\n            low = mid + 1\n        else: # array[mid] > target\n            high = mid - 1\n            \n    return result"}
