{"task_id": "Mbpp/794", "solution": "def text_starta_endb(input_string: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Validates if string starts with 'a' and ends with 'b'.\n    Allows any characters (including none) between the starting 'a' and ending 'b'.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string:\n        return False\n    if len(input_string) < 2:\n        return False\n    \n    return input_string[0] == 'a' and input_string[-1] == 'b'"}
